@guide H_Arathi
@name Arathi Highlands (Hammerfall)
@faction Horde
@levels 32-35
@zone Arathi Highlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Hammerfall: the raising spirits and raptor quests, Call to Arms at Stromgarde, the sigils and the Shards of Myzrael.
@next H_Badlands

fp Hammerfall
bind Hammerfall
accept Hammerfall | Gor'mul.
accept The Princess Trapped | The Shards of Myzrael, south-east.
accept Foul Magics
turnin Hammerfall | Tor'gan.
accept 672 Raising Spirits | Tor'gan.
complete 672 Raising Spirits | Highland Striders.
turnin 672 Raising Spirits
accept 674 Raising Spirits
complete 674 Raising Spirits
turnin 674 Raising Spirits
accept 675 Raising Spirits
turnin The Hammer May Fall | Drum Fel.
accept 677 Call to Arms | Drum Fel.
complete 677 Call to Arms | Syndicate at Northfold Manor.
complete Foul Magics | Syndicate mages.
complete The Princess Trapped | Kobolds at Drywhisker Gorge.
turnin 677 Call to Arms
accept 678 Call to Arms
turnin The Princess Trapped
accept Stones of Binding
complete 678 Call to Arms | Stromgarde Keep.
complete 675 Raising Spirits
turnin Foul Magics
turnin 675 Raising Spirits
accept 701 Guile of the Raptor | Tor'gan offers it once Raising Spirits is done.
complete 701 Guile of the Raptor | Highland raptors.
turnin 701 Guile of the Raptor
accept 702 Guile of the Raptor
complete Stones of Binding | Burning Key drops from Burning Exile. Cresting Key: loot Stone of East Binding.
turnin 678 Call to Arms
complete 702 Guile of the Raptor
turnin 702 Guile of the Raptor
accept 847 Guile of the Raptor
complete 847 Guile of the Raptor
turnin 847 Guile of the Raptor
turnin Stones of Binding
accept Breaking the Keystone
complete Breaking the Keystone | Rod of Order drops from Fozruk.
turnin Breaking the Keystone
level 35
train
note Fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp (Stranglethorn Vale).
